<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">QUESTIONNAIRE · V1.0</view><view class="title">{{title}}</view><view class="sub">{{child.name}} · 根据实际情况填写，不清楚的项目可以注明。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取问卷…</view><block wx:else><view class="card"><block wx:if="{{kind === 'initial'}}"><view class="section">健康背景</view><view class="field"><text class="label">出生史 / 早产等情况</text><textarea value="{{answers.birth_history}}" data-key="birth_history" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">家族过敏史</text><textarea value="{{answers.family}}" data-key="family" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/></view></block><view class="section">喂养与营养</view><view class="field"><text class="label">当前喂养方式</text><picker range="{{options.feeding}}" data-key="feeding" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{answers.feeding}} ▾</view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{infant}}" class="field"><text class="label">奶量、配方类型或辅食添加情况</text><textarea value="{{answers.infant}}" data-key="infant" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">正在回避的食物</text><textarea value="{{answers.avoid}}" data-key="avoid" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">替代食物及营养补充</text><textarea value="{{answers.substitute}}" data-key="substitute" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">近期食欲 / 摄入情况</text><picker range="{{options.appetite}}" data-key="appetite" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{answers.appetite}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="section">症状与执行情况</view><text class="label">近期症状（可多选）</text><checkbox-group bindchange="symptoms" class="checks"><label wx:for="{{symptomChoices}}" wx:key="value"><checkbox value="{{item.value}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" color="#356f5c"/><text>{{item.value}}</text></label></checkbox-group><view class="field"><text class="label">与上次相比的症状变化</text><picker range="{{options.change}}" data-key="change" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{answers.change}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">症状时间、疑似诱因或补充说明</text><textarea value="{{answers.symptom_notes}}" data-key="symptom_notes" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">管理方案执行情况</text><picker range="{{options.adherence}}" data-key="adherence" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{answers.adherence}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">希望医护关注的问题</text><textarea value="{{answers.concerns}}" data-key="concerns" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/></view></view><view class="notice">如出现呼吸困难等急性严重症状，请及时就医，不要等待问卷或线上留言处理。</view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="save" data-status="draft" disabled="{{busy}}">保存草稿</button><button class="primary" bindtap="save" data-status="submitted" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">提交问卷</button></view></block></view>
